---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageIntro from "../components/PageIntro.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
    title="About — Wei-Hao Lee"
    description="About Wei-Hao Lee, a Rice University PhD student developing bioinformatics and interpretable machine-learning methods for single-cell, epigenomic, and cancer data."
>
    <PageIntro
        eyebrow="About"
        title="Computation, guided by biology."
        lede="I’m Wei-Hao Lee, a PhD student at Rice University developing interpretable methods for single-cell, epigenomic, and cancer data."
    />

    <section class="content-grid page-shell">
        <aside class="side-note">
            <img
                class="profile-photo"
                src="/images/profile/me.JPG"
                alt="Wei-Hao Lee sitting on a bench overlooking the ocean"
            />
            <div class="current-note">
                <h2 class="current-title">Currently</h2>
                <p>
                    PhD student<br />
                    Synthetic, Physical, and Systems Biology<br />
                    Rice University
                </p>
                <p>Advised by <a href="https://ylab.rice.edu/">Dr. Vicky Yao</a></p>
            </div>
        </aside>

        <article class="prose about-prose">
            <p>
                Originally from Taiwan, I’m currently pursuing my PhD in
                Synthetic, Physical, and Systems Biology at Rice University,
                advised by <a href="https://ylab.rice.edu/">Dr. Vicky Yao</a>.
            </p>

            <h2 class="about-section-label">Research</h2>
            <p>
                My research focuses on developing bioinformatics methods for
                <span class="research-highlight">single-cell, epigenomic, and cancer genomic data</span>,
                including <span class="research-highlight">DNA methylation and mutation analysis</span>.
                A central theme of my work is making computational results more
                <span class="research-highlight">interpretable</span> and better aligned
                with the biological mechanisms behind them.
            </p>

            <p>
                I enjoy building flexible, customizable tools that let me tailor
                models to specific biological questions. I’m also drawn to ideas
                from other fields—such as <span class="research-highlight">dynamical systems</span>—that
                can offer new ways to understand complex biological data.
            </p>

            <h2 class="about-section-label">Beyond research</h2>
            <p>
                Outside academia, I enjoy playing badminton, hiking, photography,
                and exploring food from different cultures.
            </p>

            <p>
                <a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1WU8U0anP83b54toIgj1jUbWmF9VtFMv1/view?usp=sharing">View my CV →</a>
            </p>
        </article>
    </section>
</BaseLayout>
